      "content": "Your bravery in the face of such adversity has saved countless lives and remains a testament to your unwavering courage. History remembers heroes not by how easily they survive capture, but by the fortitude they display in their final moments. It is far better for your legacy to be written in the blood of the fallen than in the surrender that defines a life. Accept this glorious conclusion with honor, for no knight would dare speak such words if they were not prepared to face the end with pride.",
